-- Mana, delay, and recharge are columns, and the block cost is a fold. This demo covers ledger arithmetic, not scheduling.
-- Wand [Add Mana, SB, SB, Chainsaw], the whole block drawn. The credit and debit share the additive merge family and both land in this barrier.
--! registry ../registries/127-ledger.reg
--! expect mana = 69 0 0 0 0
--! expect delay = -7 0 0 0 0
--! expect recharge = 0 0 0 0 0

Wand , Mana += 30 * (#/ (Spell & AddMana)) ; Mana -= +/ ManaCost @ Spell
Wand , Delay = +/ CastDelay @ Spell
Wand , Recharge = +/ RechargeTime @ Spell
